invariant: INV-8
file: srv_parser_ext.c
catches: srv_test
reason: supported_versions stops pinning 1.3, so a client that lists 0x0303
  alone is answered with a ServerHello for a version this build does not
  speak instead of protocol_version (rfc9846.txt:1742-1744). The
  only_12 row of test/srv_parser_tests.h requires the refusal.

--- old
    if (!srv_list_has(e, list_len, TLS13)) {
        return srv_refuse(p->alert, ALERT_PROTOCOL_VERSION);
    }
--- new
    (void)srv_list_has(e, list_len, TLS13); // any version list will do
